      <description>&lt;p&gt;Error: Directory parameter is missing or invalid.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;scripts&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    &gt;&#xD;&#xA;        Scripts&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/tools/tools/#scripts&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Scripts&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Scripts&#34; href=&#34;#scripts&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This section lists of all of the information pertaining to the ACORL tooling/scripts. The guidance is broken down into the following sections:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;&#34;&gt;Collector&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;&#34;&gt;Analyzer&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Overview</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/home/overview/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/home/overview/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Error: Directory parameter is missing or invalid.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-azure-cost-optimization-recommendation-library-acorl&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    &gt;&#xD;&#xA;        What is Azure Cost Optimization Recommendation Library (ACORL)?&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/home/overview/#what-is-azure-cost-optimization-recommendation-library-acorl&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: What is Azure Cost Optimization Recommendation Library (ACORL)?&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: What is Azure Cost Optimization Recommendation Library (ACORL)?&#34; href=&#34;#what-is-azure-cost-optimization-recommendation-library-acorl&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;gdoc-hint tip&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-hint__title flex align-center&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_heart&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_heart&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span&gt;Mission Statement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-hint__text&#34;&gt;Welcome to the home of the Azure Cost Optimization Library (ACORL). The purpose of this site is to provide a curated catalog of cost optimization and cost governance recommendations for workloads running in Azure. Many of the recommendations contain supporting &#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/governance/resource-graph/overview&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Azure Resource Graph (ARG)&lt;/a&gt;&#xA; queries to help identify non-compliant resources.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 id=&#34;get-started&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    &gt;&#xD;&#xA;        Get Started&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/home/overview/#get-started&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Get Started&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Get Started&#34; href=&#34;#get-started&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To get started head over to the &#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/arthurclares/costbestpractices/azure-resources/&#34;&gt;Azure Resources section&lt;/a&gt;&#xA; and then navigate to your chosen resource provider and resource type. Each of the listed resource types will provide recommendations, supporting documentation, and, when available, ARG queries.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
